; A balance assertion is checked while the journal is parsed, so it counts
; only postings that appear before it in the file.  Date order then drops
; the later-dated ones; it never adds an earlier-dated posting that the
; file places after the assertion.  The manual (Balance verification)
; documents both halves.

2024/07/10 Rent
    Expenses:Rent               $500.00
    Assets:Checking            $-500.00 = $500.00

2024/07/01 Paycheck
    Assets:Checking            $1000.00
    Income:Salary

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 9:
While parsing posting:
  Assets:Checking            $-500.00 = $500.00
                                        ^^^^^^^
Error: Balance assertion off by $1000.00 (expected to see $-500.00)
end test
